WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.070
That'll do... Yeah!

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.240
Cheers!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.480
Darling, thanks for waiting.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.320
Thanks for waiting.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.120
Good-bye!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.060
Hikaru!
Good-bye!

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:21.140
Good-bye!

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.660
I'm sorry... but I've...

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.760
The results were... far beyond even my wildest imagination!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.040
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.930
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.930
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.070
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.840
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.810
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.950
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.820
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.790
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.960
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.900
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:25.680
Kyosuke Timetrips! The Third Christmas.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:38.520
That'll do... Yeah!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.230
Merry Christmas, Mr. Kasuga!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.800
Merry Christmas, Mr. Indecisive!

00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:06.710
Kazuya, Jingoro, you can come out now!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:13.660
Merry Christmas! Merry Christmas!

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:23.330
Good! We'll get a ton of laughs with this as our opening act!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.010
Gimme a break...

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:32.980
You know why Christmas is celebrated, don't you?

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.950
It's not to honor Jesus.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.980
It's there for us to enjoy!

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:43.410
Hail Amida Buddha...

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.550
Why you!

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.950
'Tis a great excuse to bring a girl you like to the party!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.820
No matter what, you've got to come to tonight's party as a couple! Right?

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.600
There's gonna be lots of fun tonight!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.410
What?! As a couple?!
There's gonna be lots of fun tonight!

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.060
Yup.
What?! As a couple?!

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:57.110
Yup.

00:03:57.110 --> 00:04:00.720
Party tickets have already been given out. Right?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:02.070
Oh! You guys!

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:11.480
Hurry! Or you're gonna be late for school!

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:18.700
Say, Kurumi... there'll be big fancy cakes with gadzillions of strawberries...

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.100
...salmon roe canapés, roasted chicken legs...
and it's all "All-U-Can-Eat!"

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:25.280
Yahoo!

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.220
Being there is more important than anything else! I'm skipping lunch!

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.070
If Kurumi's going, then I will too.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.200
Yes!
If Kurumi's going, then I will too.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:34.600
And so, a double Golden Couple
is thus created!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.490
K...K...Kasuga...

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:41.270
...have you talked to the Lady Hikaru yet?

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:44.840
Huh? W...W...Well...

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.460
H...Hikaru...

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:52.590
...and... Ayukawa...

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:59.090
I'm faced with a dilemma,
trying to... decide who to ask...

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:05.480
Later, Kasuga!

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.440
Later!
Later, Kasuga!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.510
A...Ayukawa!

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:17.890
Ayukawa!

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.600
What's up?

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.280
Er...

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.910
Yippee! Sempai!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.350
H...Hikaru!

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:32.480
I'm so touched! I heard that you're taking me to the party tonight.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.270
What?!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.010
Komatsu told me so.
What?!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:35.940
Oh, really...
Komatsu told me so.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:36.030
Oh, really...

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:39.630
What kind of a dress would you like me to wear, Darling?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:47.400
Oh! Madoka, would you like to go also?

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.540
You might want to ask somebody!

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.790
Sorry, but I can't...

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.190
I'll be with my sister and her gang.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:59.130
I see. That's too bad.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.130
Hikaru, have fun...
I see. That's too bad.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:03.670
Thank you so much!
Hikaru, have fun...

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.630
A...Ayukawa...

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.670
Ayukawa...

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:17.950
"Xmas Party"

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:31.790
What's wrong with me wearing it
just for today?!

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:35.120
I was gonna wear it!

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:38.080
Why can't I?! It's not like it'll wear out!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:40.140
No! No way!

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:56.040
Listen, you guys!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.290
Would you knock it off?!

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.370
Dammit! Hikaru was...

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.680
...gonna be... gonna be my date!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.690
Y...Yuusaku! Calm down! Calm down!

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.520
Birthdays and Christmas are two of...

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.940
...the biggest events for lovers everywhere!

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:19.510
And, look what you did...

00:07:19.510 --> 00:07:21.700
W...W...Well, I can explain...
And, look what you did...

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:21.790
And, look what you did...

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:25.590
Even though I, Hino Yuusaku,
am known for my patience and endurance...

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:28.580
I cannot endure you any longer!

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.380
Later!

00:07:38.380 --> 00:07:40.430
K...Kasuga!

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:48.990
Darling, thanks for waiting.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:51.390
Er... Well...

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:54.860
Darling, I really appreciate your asking me out.

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:57.400
This has got to be the bestest Christmas present!

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.450
Well...

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.720
Pardon me...

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.280
Huh?
Pardon me...

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:08.720
How do I get to the Senior Citizens' Center?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:11.770
"The Senior Citizens' Center?"

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:15.110
Er... Well, lemme see... Go straight down this road...

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:17.310
...turn right at the third corner...

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:20.580
...then when you see the convenience store
on the corner, take a left...

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.850
...keep going until it ends, then turn left...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.680
...and you'll see a barber shop.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.320
Now, keep in mind you'll soon be turning right, but...

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.950
...you first go left,
watch out for the police box, and...

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:31.890
...then walk another 300 meters.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:35.530
Next, bear right, go 500 meters, and you'll see a big building.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:38.870
That's where it is. Did you get that?

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.140
I'm sorry, but would you repeat that once more?

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:42.230
"Obaachan:" Grandmother, or,
as in this case, any old woman.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:46.180
Well, listen to me carefully now, Obaachan.
"Obaachan:" Grandmother, or,
as in this case, any old woman.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:51.770
Oh!

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:54.700
You've done it, playboy!
Oh!

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:59.230
I had so many choices that I had a tough time decidin'!

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:01.880
Ow...Owowow!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.910
Shall we go?

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.280
Oh! Hey!

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:07.990
Huh? Oh!
Oh! Hey!

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:08.950
Hey!
Huh? Oh!

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:09.000
Hey!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.130
You have to come as a couple in order to get into this party!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.440
That's right! That's our rule!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:17.080
She's Tamiko the Macaw. Be kind to her.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.090
I'm Tamiko. I'm Tamiko.

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.880
H...Hey!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.850
Can you deny the beautiful love between man and bird?!

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:27.690
Whatcha gonna do during the dances?!

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:31.590
In my neighborhood... she's known as
"Tamiko the Disco Queen!"

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.860
Got a problem with that?

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.000
Well... whatever you say, sir...

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.200
Cheers!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:09.090
It's so much fun in here...

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:12.770
Madoka should've come. Right, Darling?

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:15.840
Er... Yeah...

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.220
Kasuga! Call for you, from Ayukawa's big sister.

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:59.560
Sure. I'll give her the message.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:06.130
In other words... Ayukawa lied to me...

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.640
On your way to a party, perhaps?

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.870
Is having fun part of your agenda for Christmas Eve?

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:20.040
What kind of a present did you get
for your significant other?

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:26.430
Er... Do you like Christmas, or... er... er...

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:30.590
Er... It seems that I've been talking to a Buddhist extremist!

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:33.550
Ayukawa!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.370
Sempai!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:58.250
Ayukawa!

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:14.720
Merry Christmas, Mr. Kasuga!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.330
Merry Christmas, Mr. Indecisive!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.500
What's going on here?!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.180
Kazuya, Jingoro! You can come out now!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:32.150
Merry Christmas! Merry Christmas! Merry Christmas! Merry Christmas!

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:41.580
Good! We'll get a ton of laughs with this as our opening act!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.130
Th...This can't be...

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.920
Komatsu! What's today?

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.750
It's the day we've been waiting for!
Christmas Eve!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.420
Wake up, why don't you!

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:54.590
That explains it!

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.650
In other words... I've "time-slipped!"

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.890
Uh-huh! All right! I've got to try it again!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.650
Without fail, I've got to ask Ayukawa out this time!

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.060
Ayukawa! Ayukawa!

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.110
Wh...What is it?

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.080
C...Come here for a sec...
Wh...What is it?

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:24.660
Listen, er...

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:25.450
What is it?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.420
Sempai! What is it?

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.980
Oh...?

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:33.090
What's up with you?!

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:35.320
Well... I was, er...
What's up with you?!

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:35.410
What's up with you?!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.570
Tonight's Christmas Party...

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:40.400
Wanna go with me?

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:40.990
What?!
Wanna go with me?

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:41.110
Wanna go with me?

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:45.170
Y'know, I had a dream where I spent Christmas Eve all by myself.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:52.140
Please, I'm begging you! Please!

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:04.780
Listen, you guys! Would you knock it off?!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.260
I didn't make it on time!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:13.220
Y...You really aren't going with Hikaru?!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:16.250
W...Well... at least not this time.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.160
Is that right?!

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:27.240
Yuusaku, are you all right?

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.360
Kasuga...

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:32.510
Man, I never realized that
you were actually half decent!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.480
I had it... all wrong before!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:46.590
I guess you can't fight fate...

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.070
Thanks for waiting.

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:02.080
It sure was... nice that I got to
ask Ayukawa out, or so I thought...

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:04.580
Kasuga...

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:05.310
Huh?
Kasuga...

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:05.400
Kasuga...

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.470
I'm glad that dream I had didn't come true.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:14.140
Pardon me...

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.380
Huh? Huh?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:19.820
How do I get to the Senior Citizens' Center?

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:23.650
Obaachan, didn't I just tell you about it?

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:24.540
What?! What?!

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.950
Er...Er... Well, er...

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:28.610
Oh, gosh... Learn it the first time, okay?

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:32.060
All right, go straight along this road...

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:36.130
Hey! You have to come as a couple in order to get into this party!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.500
That's right! That's our rule!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.380
Huh?! Huh?!

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:44.920
She's Ruriko the Goldfish. Treat her kindly.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.200
H...Hey!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:50.110
Can you deny the beautiful love between man and goldfish?!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.560
What'cha gonna do during the dances?!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.500
In my town... she's known as
"Ruriko the Syncro-Swimming Ace!"

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:57.300
Huh?! Oh!

00:15:57.300 --> 00:16:00.270
Huh... Huh?!
Huh?! Oh!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:32.780
About tonight's party...
Komatsu told me about it...

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:36.790
When I went to your place,
I was told everyone had left.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:39.640
So I...

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.010
Madoka...

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:50.550
I dreamed of spending a wonderful Christmas Eve with you, Sempai!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:53.450
H...Hikaru...

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:58.770
Good-bye...

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.140
Hikaru!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:02.080
Kasuga...

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.620
I'm sorry... but I've got to...

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.670
What?!

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:17.260
The results were... far beyond even my wildest imagination!

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.910
I'm the lowest!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.370
I've got to do something!

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:25.460
Power, take me back... again, just once again...

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:28.490
Back to the morning!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.880
Merry Christmas, Mr. Kasuga!

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.490
Merry Christmas, Mr. Indecisive!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:48.930
Yes!

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:50.360
Yes! Yes!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:51.280
I'm back!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:52.020
Gone wacko...?
I'm back!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:54.210
Uh-huh.
Gone wacko...?

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:54.300
Uh-huh.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:59.710
Are you trying to do something I'm praying you won't do?!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:02.180
W...W...Well, I can explain...

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.350
Here it comes!

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.860
Today, there will be no mercy!

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:23.040
What the...?! Why!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.550
Ushiko!

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:46.020
Umao!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.820
Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:51.670
And, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.420
Obaachan?

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.020
Yes?
Obaachan?

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.650
The Senior Citizens' Center, right?
Yes?

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:02.780
The Senior Citizens' Center, right?

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:03.790
Y...Yes...
The Senior Citizens' Center, right?

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.790
I know, I know.
Y...Yes...

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:05.920
I know, I know.

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.950
Huh?!
I know, I know.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:12.710
...and that's the Senior Citizens' Center.
Okay? You can't miss it.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.730
Why, thank you very much!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:19.700
Don't you forget it now...
'Cause I won't be back again, okay?

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.430
Huh?!

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.040
You really won't be back here again?

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:28.860
Most likely not.

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:35.110
She's the breakdancing pioneer,
known in my house as "Shell-Spinning Nori!"

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.850
Well, whatever you say, sir.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.790
Huh? Oh!

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:42.760
Oh!
Huh? Oh!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:49.510
D...Don't you know,
you have to be a couple to get in!

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:49.930
Right?!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:51.160
Huh? Uh-huh!
Right?!

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:55.780
Let's make it okay to come as a single, couple or triple.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:58.810
Don't you agree, Madoka?

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.770
Uh-huh...
Don't you agree, Madoka?

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:08.920
Even if I'm accused of double-dealing...

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.880
...I just don't want to make either one
feel lonely and sad.

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:14.920
Cheers!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.240
Kasuga, get this...

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.050
Yuusaku says... 'til he was in fifth grade...

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.700
...oh, man, my tummy hurts...

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.640
...he believed in Santa Claus!

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.610
What the hell?!
...he believed in Santa Claus!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:46.510
Ow!

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:56.600
Santa Claus?!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.330
Kyosuke!

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.320
Grandpa!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:07.360
I've brought you
a Christmas present, Kyosuke!

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.280
And, here's the icing on the cake.

00:22:54.250 --> 00:22:57.220
A white Christmas...

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:05.160
Grandpa!

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:08.820
Oh! Kyosuke! Well, was that a hit or what?

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:10.060
Grandpa!

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:15.070
This is way overboard!

00:23:27.220 --> 00:23:30.330
Merry Christmas, Mr. Kasuga!

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:33.390
Merry Christmas, Mr. Indecisive!

00:23:40.330 --> 00:23:42.300
Merry Christmas!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:58.420
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.420 --> 00:24:02.300
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:14.010
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:19.780
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.780 --> 00:24:28.120
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.120 --> 00:24:35.660
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:43.300
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.300 --> 00:24:50.940
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:50.940 --> 00:24:58.480
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:04.500
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:12.050 --> 00:25:13.800
Er... A... Ayukawa...

00:25:13.800 --> 00:25:15.070
...oops, I mean...

00:25:15.070 --> 00:25:18.170
Hey, Madoka, wash my back, 'cause I'm taking a bath!

00:25:18.170 --> 00:25:19.500
Just kidding!

00:25:19.500 --> 00:25:23.050
I meant it as a joke,
but the hypnosis really worked...

00:25:23.050 --> 00:25:25.740
...and Ayukawa has become my slave!

00:25:25.740 --> 00:25:30.130
Next time: "Hypnotizing Madoka! Kyosuke's Risky New Year's."
